    <node id="Early Human Evolution and Migration">
      <data key="d0">Early Human Evolution and Migration</data>
      <data key="d1">historical_concept_or_event</data>
      <data key="d2">The entity "Early Human Evolution and Migration" focuses on the theories and processes involved in the evolution and migration of early human populations. This historical event encompasses the significant journey of early humans, tracing their origins in Africa to their subsequent spread across other continents including Asia, Europe, Australia, and the Americas.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-7e64e2403dd590a083e0fbec3e790668&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-91a847d29a702803fcc6217de2a69c95</data>
