    <node id="Ancient Mesopotamia">
      <data key="d0">Ancient Mesopotamia</data>
      <data key="d1">civilization_or_empire</data>
      <data key="d2">Aregion in Western Asia, including parts of modern-day Iraq, Syria, and Kuwait, Ancient Mesopotamia was a crucial cradle of early urban civilization and significant cultural developments such as cuneiform writing. Specifically situated between the Tigris and Euphrates rivers, Ancient Mesopotamia encompasses several notable ancient civilizations that flourished in this fertile area.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-7e64e2403dd590a083e0fbec3e790668&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c1d02d55a0d3b389107528715e89a23a</data>
