    </node>
    <node id="Seljuk Migration">
      <data key="d0">Seljuk Migration</data>
      <data key="d1">historical_event</data>
      <data key="d2">Seljuk Migration refers to the movement of a Turko-Persian nomadic group that significantly altered geopolitics during this period. Specifically, the Seljuk Turks migrated into Persia and Anatolia, resulting in major political transformations in these regions and fostering competition with the Abbasid Caliphate.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-70a588c1e9025f193747e47553aa2ca6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c13c9d68535c84e9a2084524eeed3c86</data>
