      <data key="d0">Call from the East</data>
      <data key="d1">historical_concept_or_event</data>
      <data key="d2">The term 'Call from the East' appears to be an event or concept related to the Crusades and religious fervor in historical sources.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c13c9d68535c84e9a2084524eeed3c86</data>
      <data key="d4">dumps/World_History_Volume_1/pages_content.json</data>
