    <node id="Pax Mongolica">
      <data key="d0">Pax Mongolica</data>
      <data key="d1">historical_concept_or_event</data>
      <data key="d2">Pax Mongolica refers to a period of relative peace and stability brought about by the Mongol Empire across their vast territories, encompassing the steppe peoples under Mongol influence. This era is characterized by a significant level of safety for trade and travel, facilitated by the overarching order maintained by the Mongols during their reign.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-2ac9bafdb2d35ccfb26b8c97281bd204&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4a7bd606960e970df3415af494e95c38&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-65567519161cbb48515c5592fd7dfa04</data>
