    </node>
    <node id="Song China">
      <data key="d0">Song China</data>
      <data key="d1">civilization_or_empire</data>
      <data key="d2">Song China is an influential civilization that emerged after the fall of the Tang dynasty and competed with steppe peoples during this historical period. This civilization played a significant role in the broader political landscape of Eurasia, interacting and competing within the region's complex network of powers. Song China is known for its distinctive political and economic structures, as well as its unique way of life.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-65567519161cbb48515c5592fd7dfa04&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4a7bd606960e970df3415af494e95c38</data>
      <data key="d4">dumps/World_History_Volume_1/pages_content.json</data>
