      <data key="d0">Venus Figurines</data>
      <data key="d1">cultural_or_religious_movement</data>
      <data key="d2">Venus Figurines are small statuettes carved from materials like stone, ivory, bone, or clay, representing women, often found in Paleolithic archaeological sites and believed to be associated with fertility.</data>
