      <data key="d0">"Fertility Symbols"|&gt;</data>
      <data key="d1">cultural_or_religious_movement"|&gt;</data>
      <data key="d2">"Fertility symbols refer to symbolic representations or artifacts linked to fertility, such as the Venus figurines, which were used during prehistoric times and represent a cultural movement focused on reproductive vitality and community values."|&gt;</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-8a7ed9ed426c677dfb751ca0d0f6c66e</data>
      <data key="d4">dumps/World_History_Volume_1/pages_content.json</data>
