      <data key="d0">&lt;Deerskin and bark lined shoes&gt;</data>
      <data key="d1">textbook_structure</data>
      <data key="d2">These shoes from Ötzi are described as being deerskin-lined with inner bark, showcasing advanced crafting techniques of the time.</data>
