      <data key="d0">&lt;Agricultural products, woven items, clay vessels&gt;</data>
      <data key="d1">&lt;source_or_artifact&gt;</data>
      <data key="d2">&lt;"These items were produced and traded by people at Çatalhöyük, showing their economic activities such as farming, textile making, and pottery production."&gt;</data>
