      <data key="d0">&lt;Trade&gt;</data>
      <data key="d1">&lt;historical_concept_or_event&gt;</data>
      <data key="d2">&lt;"Trade was an essential part of the economy in Çatalhöyük, involving the exchange of goods like obsidian with distant regions, reflecting extensive commercial networks."&gt;</data>
