    <node id="3000 BCE">
      <data key="d0">3000 BCE</data>
      <data key="d1">time_period</data>
      <data key="d2">In 3000 BCE, several significant developments occurred simultaneously across different regions. In Sumer, a crucial period began where cuneiform script emerged as a genuine writing system, marking an important milestone in early Mesopotamian civilization. Simultaneously, Neolithic settlements started growing potatoes and manioc in the Andes Mountains region of South America, indicating agricultural advancements during this time.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ce95f4fd988337875531ba7f4b862b38&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-be218f59dc8386a1e2c745f10659dfa3</data>
      <data key="d4">dumps/World_History_Volume_1/pages_content.json</data>
