      <data key="d1">geographical_location</data>
      <data key="d2">The Yangtze River valley refers to a geographic region surrounding the Yangtze River in China, which includes the sites of Pengtoushan and Bashidang, known for early Neolithic settlements with evidence of agriculture.</data>
