      <data key="d0">&lt;City-States&gt;</data>
      <data key="d1">civilization_or_empire</data>
      <data key="d2">Multiple independent city-states in ancient Mesopotamia that developed complex social structures and technologies.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-bacddcb0411fbd18f80694e00c36c414</data>
