      <data key="d0">&lt;Textbook Structure (Elements)</data>
      <data key="d1">textbook_structure</data>
      <data key="d2">Structural components or frameworks used in educational texts to organize content logically for comprehension.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-bacddcb0411fbd18f80694e00c36c414</data>
