      <data key="d0">"1258 BCE"</data>
      <data key="d1">time_period</data>
      <data key="d2">The timeframe that includes significant events such as the Treaty of Kadesh, a crucial diplomatic and military agreement in ancient history.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b8d6d7a01f04863f017d0ad8ee1b4e77</data>
