      <data key="d0">Demanding Surrender Without Fight</data>
      <data key="d1">historical_concept_or_event</data>
      <data key="d2">The concept of demanding a city's surrender without engaging in direct conflict is highlighted as a tactic used by the Neo-Assyrians to avoid bloodshed and negotiate more easily with their subjects.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-32203ce1d651482247b4cb8df780c42e</data>
