      <data key="d0">Calculated Frightfulness - Neo-Assyrian Strategy</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">("The 'calculated frightfulness' strategy involved the demonstration of harsh consequences for resistance, employing various forms of torture to instill fear in the minds of potential rebels. This was a key element in the Neo-Assyrians' approach to maintaining control over their vast empire.")</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-32203ce1d651482247b4cb8df780c42e</data>
