      <data key="d1">source_or_artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">This small stone engraving shows Pharaoh Akhenaten and his queen Nefertiti with their daughters, created during Akhenaten’s lifetime. (Credit: “Akhenaten, Nefertiti, and three daughters beneath the Aten” by Richard Mortel/Flickr, CC BY 2.0).</data>
