      <data key="d1">source_or_artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">A 1939 text written by Sigmund Freud, suggesting that Moses was a priest of Akhenaten's religion and contributed to the formation of monotheistic Judaism.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-eade46978a4c4daa5b0a0ffa6887c985</data>
