      <data key="d1">&lt;civilization_or_empire&gt;</data>
      <data key="d2">&lt;"An ancient empire that at its height extended across Western Asia, Eastern Europe, and Northern Africa during the Achaemenid dynasty, known for its cultural achievements and extensive trade networks."&gt;</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b7685a6f4e6e873aa232bfe92f1fbd33</data>
