    <node id="4.38 The Infant Moses Figure Reference">
      <data key="d0">4.38 The Infant Moses Figure Reference</data>
      <data key="d1">textbook_structure</data>
      <data key="d2">Figure 4.38 is a reference to a painting depicting the biblical account of Pharaoh's daughter discovering the infant Moses, which provides an illustration for discussions about the birth and early life of Moses as described in Exodus.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-101f85f166b49ff1dfbecddc6687ab0f</data>
      <data key="d4">dumps/World_History_Volume_1/pages_content.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1783210856</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Exodus 2:1-10 (KJV)">
      <data key="d0">Exodus 2:1-10 (KJV)</data>
      <data key="d1">textbook_structure</data>
      <data key="d2">Exodus 2:1-10 (King James Version) is a textual source providing the biblical story of Moses, his mother's attempt to save him, and Pharaoh’s daughter finding and adopting him.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-101f85f166b49ff1dfbecddc6687ab0f</data>
      <data key="d4">dumps/World_History_Volume_1/pages_content.json</data>
