      <data key="d2">&lt;"The Imperial Court of Qin Shihuang Emperor was the administrative center and residence of the emperor during the Qin dynasty. It played a pivotal role in implementing the unification policies, legal reforms, and infrastructure projects like the Great Wall and the Terracotta Army."</data>
