    <node id="Jewish laws and practices are described in detail, emphasizing monotheism, moral conduct, dietary restrictions, Sabbath observance, respect for women, and charity.">
      <data key="d0">Jewish laws and practices are described in detail, emphasizing monotheism, moral conduct, dietary restrictions, Sabbath observance, respect for women, and charity.</data>
      <data key="d1">cultural_or_religious_movement</data>
      <data key="d2">The set of religious and cultural norms followed by Jewish communities, focusing on key principles like worshiping one god, adhering to specific ethical standards, maintaining particular dietary laws, observing the Sabbath, showing respect towards women, and practicing generosity.</data>
