      <data key="d0">Daoism Encouraging Nonaction</data>
      <data key="d1">historical_figure</data>
      <data key="d2">Daoism emphasized 'nonaction' (wu wei) as a key political philosophy and lifestyle principle among the Hundred Schools of Thought.</data>
