      <data key="d0">Xianbei Origin of Northern Wei Dynasty</data>
      <data key="d1">historical_figure</data>
      <data key="d2">The Xianbei people were pivotal in establishing the Northern Wei dynasty, setting a significant precedent for later Chinese history.</data>
