    <node id="Agriculture to Livestock Herding Shift">
      <data key="d0">Agriculture to Livestock Herding Shift</data>
      <data key="d1">historical_concept_or_event</data>
      <data key="d2">Around 1500 BCE, societal changes due to climate shifts prompted Inner Asian Steppe inhabitants to rely more on herding than farming as a primary subsistence method.</data>
