    <node id="Monsoon Winds Supporting Cultural Exchange">
      <data key="d0">Monsoon Winds Supporting Cultural Exchange</data>
      <data key="d1">time_period</data>
      <data key="d2">Monsoons played a crucial role in facilitating the transfer of ideas, arts, and technologies between South Asian civilizations and their neighbors to the east during specific periods.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-6444c71b86edf5337c96dbb26fdca53e</data>
