      <data key="d1">&lt;time_period&gt;</data>
      <data key="d2">&lt;"The era of Ancient Greece from 500 to 323 BCE, marked by a peak in philosophical thought, literary achievements, and political organization under the rule of notable city-states like Athens."&gt;</data>
