      <data key="d0">&lt;"Greek Dark Ages"&gt;</data>
      <data key="d1">&lt;historical_period&gt;</data>
      <data key="d2">&lt;"A period of cultural darkness in Greece from approximately 1100 BCE to 800 BCE following the collapse of Mycenaean civilization. This period saw little historical documentation and limited cultural advancement."&gt;</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-deeeaa267faae20e29663a365d84657c</data>
