      <data key="d0">&lt;"Athenian democracy"&gt;</data>
      <data key="d1">&lt;political_system&gt;</data>
      <data key="d2">&lt;"A direct democratic form of governance in Athens characterized by citizen participation in decision-making processes through assemblies and councils."&gt;</data>
