    <node id="Classical period">
      <data key="d0">Classical period</data>
      <data key="d1">time_period</data>
      <data key="d2">The Classical period refers to a significant era in ancient Greek history where artists and culture began to develop their own unique style, moving away from the influence of Egyptian or Phoenician art styles. During this time, Greek sculptors started producing more lifelike poses for their statues, contributing to the refined and naturalistic characteristics that define Classical art.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-92db262d76cb92ec5e196188c5a0fba7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d5c63b2791e827294c58570d7303987d</data>
      <data key="d4">dumps/World_History_Volume_1/pages_content.json</data>
