      <data key="d0">Greek marble statue</data>
      <data key="d1">source_or_artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">A Greek marble statue of a youth from 580 BCE shows similarities with Egyptian artistic conventions in its pose and stance, indicating how Egyptian influences permeated Greek art during the Classical period.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-92db262d76cb92ec5e196188c5a0fba7</data>
      <data key="d4">dumps/World_History_Volume_1/pages_content.json</data>
