    </node>
    <node id="Battle of Zama">
      <data key="d0">Battle of Zama</data>
      <data key="d1">military_battle</data>
      <data key="d2">The Battle of Zama was a crucial and climactic engagement during the Second Punic War. It resulted in the decisive victory of Roman forces under Publius Cornelius Scipio Africanus over the Carthaginian army led by Hannibal Barca, earning Scipio the honorific title Africanus. This victory secured Rome's dominance over North Africa and effectively ended the Second Punic War with a resounding triumph for the Romans.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-7595511c6280259b348ea8ca3413a6d3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-102a3de218fabdb69815ca7d8d632b0a</data>
