    <node id="Macedonia">
      <data key="d0">Macedonia</data>
      <data key="d1">region</data>
      <data key="d2">Macedonia was an ancient kingdom located primarily in the region of northern Greece along the southern slopes of Mount Olympus. It played a significant role in early Greek history under kings such as Philip II and later Alexander the Great, who further unified the territories and significantly expanded Greek influence through extensive conquests.</data>
