      <data key="d0">Naviculari</data>
      <data key="d1">cultural_or_religious_movement</data>
      <data key="d2">Government-controlled elite class of shipowners known as 'naviculari' who were compelled to join supervisable groups called 'colegia', often gaining public service exemptions for supplying the 'Annona'.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-26ccbf3441b6b8fad246e6cd56535b53</data>
      <data key="d4">dumps/World_History_Volume_1/pages_content.json</data>
