      <data key="d0">Third and Fourth Century Trade Controls</data>
      <data key="d1">historical_event</data>
      <data key="d2">By the third and fourth centuries CE, intensified control over naviculari was enforced; supplying grain contracts under 'Annona' became compulsory.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-26ccbf3441b6b8fad246e6cd56535b53</data>
