      <data key="d0">Hadrian (138-161 CE) and Annona</data>
      <data key="d1">historical_concept_or_event</data>
      <data key="d2">Empperor Hadrian associated himself with the 'Annona' to create a positive image among the populace, demonstrating its political usefulness for his rule.</data>
