    <node id="Italy">
      <data key="d0">Italy</data>
      <data key="d1">geographical_location</data>
      <data key="d2">Italy, a geographical location significant in historical context, was primarily governed and controlled by the Ostrogoths during Emperor Justinian's reign. At this time, Italy encompassed numerous territories that were formerly under Roman jurisdiction, highlighting its importance as a region worth reconquest for the Eastern Roman Empire and later for Justinian’s military endeavors.</data>
