      <data key="d0">&lt;Cleopatra&gt;</data>
      <data key="d1">historical_figure</data>
      <data key="d2">Historical figure who ruled Egypt during the late Hellenistic period and is known for her relationships with Julius Caesar and Mark Antony, as well as for her strategic significance in political conflicts of the time.</data>
