    <node id="&lt;Roman Empire&gt;">
      <data key="d0">&lt;Roman Empire&gt;</data>
      <data key="d1">civilization_or_empire</data>
      <data key="d2">The Roman Empire, which existed from 27 BCE to 476 CE (for the Western Empire), was one of the largest empires in world history, spanning Europe, North Africa, and parts of Asia. It had a significant impact on law, government, architecture, and the arts. The empire rose to prominence in the 1st century BCE and experienced its fall with the collapse of the Western Roman Empire in the 5th century CE, a period marked by substantial legal, social, and cultural developments.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-ada1cb5eb9784a9ea1025f60a1b39b64&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2b5f6c1ce60c5a963cfeed75216a1324</data>
