    <node id="&lt;&quot;Riot in Alexandria&quot;">
      <data key="d0">&lt;"Riot in Alexandria"</data>
      <data key="d1">historical_concept_or_event</data>
      <data key="d2">A significant riot that occurred in 38 CE in Alexandria and was a result of placing Emperor images into the city’s synagogues, leading to tensions with the Jewish community. It also caused Caligula to issue an order to remove such images from synagogues.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-a2d1db24c99f5fef7c3bc0aa3497e439</data>
