      <data key="d0">&lt;"Jerusalem siege"</data>
      <data key="d1">historical_concept_or_event</data>
      <data key="d2">The military operation led by Vespasian and his son Titus, who besieged Jerusalem during the revolt. This siege ultimately resulted in the destruction of the Temple.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-a2d1db24c99f5fef7c3bc0aa3497e439</data>
