      <data key="d0">Roman citizenship acquisition</data>
      <data key="d1">historical_concept_or_event</data>
      <data key="d2">The process by which one could acquire Roman citizenship, often through various methods such as being born in Rome or being granted citizenship by the emperor.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-f7e64d0c2e104d943718b5901bc66b8c</data>
