    </node>
    <node id="Cuzco">
      <data key="d0">Cuzco</data>
      <data key="d1">geographical_location</data>
      <data key="d2">Cuzco is a historical city that emerged as an agricultural village by around 1000 CE and later became the center of Inca military power and the capital of the Inca Empire. From Cuzco, expansion and imperial control were organized, making it a pivotal hub for Incan civilization and governance.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-9262b57773b73a3ec93d925625b303fc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a9f934b57bac158210269fad101dae91</data>
