    <node id="200 BCE">
      <data key="d0">200 BCE</data>
      <data key="d1">time_period</data>
      <data key="d2">200 BCE is a significant period in the context of the Empires of Faith. This timeframe also coincides with the emergence of the Nazca culture, as evidenced by archaeological finds such as a notable Condor illustration. The combined information suggests that 200 BCE holds substantial historical and cultural importance, marked both by shifts in imperial power and the rise of early civilizations like the Nazca.</data>
