    <node id="1000 CE">
      <data key="d0">1000 CE</data>
      <data key="d1">time_period</data>
      <data key="d2">The entity 1000 CE is associated with the emergence of agricultural villagers in Cuzco. During this time period, significant developments also occurred in other parts of the Americas, such as Chaco Canyon where a Taaqa 'man' was present at Pueblo Bonita. This timeline reflects various cultural and societal transformations across different regions during the early 11th century CE.</data>
