    <node id="Third Century BCE">
      <data key="d0">Third Century BCE</data>
      <data key="d1">time_period</data>
      <data key="d2">By the start of the third century BCE, peoples in the Americas began to form complex agricultural-based societies, marking a significant transition from hunter-gatherer existence. During this same period, there were also notable developments on the Mediterranean coast as significant challenges to Carthage's control over North Africa arose, particularly with the rise of Rome.</data>
