    <node id="Teotihuacán">
      <data key="d0">Teotihuacán</data>
      <data key="d1">geographical_location</data>
      <data key="d2">Teotihuacán was a major and influential Mesoamerican city located approximately thirty miles northeast of Mexico City. It had a significant impact on the cultures of the region during the 1st to 6th centuries CE, playing a crucial role in regional connections and interactions through its extensive influence over surrounding areas.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-03a15d067f74707fd348b5bcb5e978e7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bc4b8410363d69af312174183b2ccd15</data>
