    <node id="&lt;Aztec Migration from Aztlan&gt;">
      <data key="d0">&lt;Aztec Migration from Aztlan&gt;</data>
      <data key="d1">&lt;historical_concept_or_event&gt;</data>
      <data key="d2">According to Aztec myths, the journey that led the Tenochcas (one of the three tribes forming the Mexica, who later founded Tenochtitlan</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-3a06215af18ec52d83a174e41c14c0a7</data>
