      <data key="d0">Lake Texcoco</data>
      <data key="d1">geographical_location</data>
      <data key="d2">Lake Texcoco is a historical geographical location that holds significant importance in the Aztec origin story, famously being the site of a mythological battle against rebels according to legend. It was also chosen as the spot by the Aztecs for establishing their city, marking a crucial moment in their history and settlement in central Mexico.</data>
