    <node id="Africa">
      <data key="d0">Africa</data>
      <data key="d1">geographical_location</data>
      <data key="d2">Africa is a geographical location comprising diverse environments such as deserts, rainforests, grasslands, which have significantly shaped ancient societies. Additionally, Africa served as the birthplace for monasticism and the Christian lifestyle, pioneering efforts by both men and women that were later imitated in Europe and other regions.</data>
