      <data key="d0">&lt;"Grasslands below the Sahara geographical_location"&gt;</data>
      <data key="d1">geographical_location</data>
      <data key="d2">The regions south of the Sahara Desert, known for diverse grassland ecosystems. This area was crucial in the spread of agriculture and livestock herding practices.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-77b80d611a0770d6a510e247aaf56af0</data>
