      <data key="d0">&lt;"The Meroitic Period in Nubia"</data>
      <data key="d1">&lt;textbook_structure&gt;</data>
      <data key="d2">&lt;"A section that would likely be found in a historical or cultural textbook, detailing key aspects of the Kushite kingdom's rule over parts of Nubia specifically. It encapsulates political control and socio-cultural changes."&gt;</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b13ca3c5039a592c7efe58cadf289401</data>
