      <data key="d0">"Syene (modern Aswan)"|</data>
      <data key="d1">geographical_location"|</data>
      <data key="d2">"At another encounter at Syene (modern Aswan in southern Egypt), the Kushite forces of Meroe appear to have gotten the better of the Romans."|&lt;|</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b382fb40434cfb000eafd84c93ff3baf</data>
