      <data key="d0">"Romans-Kush conflict"|</data>
      <data key="d1">historical_concept_or_event"|</data>
      <data key="d2">"Kushite soldiers pillaged the city and took with them a number of statues and other valuables, including a bronze head of the Roman emperor Augustus. Not a group to leave such an affront unanswered, the Romans counterattacked and nearly destroyed Napata."|&lt;|</data>
