      <data key="d0">American Revolutionary War</data>
      <data key="d1">time_period</data>
      <data key="d2">(1775–1783) - A significant armed conflict between Great Britain and its American colonies, also known as the "American War of Independence", leading to the establishment of the United States. The war was supported by European powers like France and Spain.</data>
