    <node id="Kingdom of Kush">
      <data key="d0">Kingdom of Kush</data>
      <data key="d1">civilization_or_empire</data>
      <data key="d2">The Kingdom of Kush was an ancient civilization that ruled over southern Egypt and northern Sudan for at least a millennium before it was subdued by Ezana during his reign in the mid-fourth century. Known for its significant wealth and remarkable production of high-quality iron during the Meroitic period, this kingdom played a crucial role in the region's history until its eventual subjugation.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-69daf8633779d8478fa1be3b5bf8fb8b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f29f9144707ccdbebcb18912cb508246</data>
