      <data key="d0">Byzantine Capital Shift</data>
      <data key="d1">historical_event</data>
      <data key="d2">The shift of the capital from Rome to Constantinople (Istanbul) is highlighted as marking a significant transition for the Roman Empire, emphasizing its new focus on eastern territories.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-f82fcaeaf8ded7ccd594a70788c5c5e9</data>
