      <data key="d0">Constantines desire to place himself at the pinnacle of Roman history</data>
      <data key="d1">historical_concept_or_event</data>
      <data key="d2">Constantine's desire is shown through the incorporation of material from earlier monuments into the Arch of Constantine.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-f2de533462f3576f00bafa628e7d6a09</data>
