    </node>
    <node id="&quot;Constantinople (modern-day Istanbul)'">
      <data key="d0">"Constantinople (modern-day Istanbul)'</data>
      <data key="d1">geographical_location</data>
      <data key="d2">Constantinople, located where modern-day Istanbul stands, was refounded by Constantine as his imperial capital in 330 CE.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-f2de533462f3576f00bafa628e7d6a09</data>
