      <data key="d0">&lt;Figure 10.8 The Serpent Column&gt;</data>
      <data key="d1">source_or_artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">Visual representation of Constantine's reign through a significant monument originally standing in ancient times and later transferred to Istanbul, symbolizing his historical and cultural impact.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-fc15c8190bd017249609745764d34f78</data>
