      <data key="d1">source_or_artifact|</data>
      <data key="d2">A temple dedicated to the Mesopotamian god Baal, which was a significant religious site in Palmyra reflecting its cultural heritage and devotion to the deity.|</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-a4164713b8d188f57453f06a2a3003ed</data>
