      <data key="d1">&lt;"cultural_or_religious_movement</data>
      <data key="d2">&lt;"The official religious institution of the Persian Empire under the Sasanians, which played a central role in the administration and social structure of the empire. Zoroastrian priests (magi) were influential in governance and societal functioning."&gt;</data>
