      <data key="d1">&lt;"time_period</data>
      <data key="d2">&lt;"A historical period marking the transition from classical antiquity to the Middle Ages, characterized by significant religious, cultural, and political changes. This period includes events like the rise of Christianity, the fall of Rome, and the development of new administrative structures."&gt;</data>
