      <data key="d1">&lt;"civilization_or_empire</data>
      <data key="d2">&lt;"A diverse group of tribes that played a significant role in the decline of the Western Roman Empire. They established various kingdoms across Europe, including regions like Gaul, Italy, and parts of Germany. Their societies were structured differently from the Romans."&gt;</data>
