    </node>
    <node id="Byzantines and Sasanians">
      <data key="d0">Byzantines and Sasanians</data>
      <data key="d1">historical_figure</data>
      <data key="d2">The Byzantine Empire and the Sasanian Empire were the two dominant powers in the region, influencing each other through policies and foreign relations.</data>
