    </node>
    <node id="Kaaba">
      <data key="d0">Kaaba</data>
      <data key="d1">source_or_artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">The Kaaba is a sacred site and structure located in Mecca, which is widely acknowledged according to Islamic tradition to have been constructed by Prophet Abraham. Considered the most sacred site in Islam, it plays a central role in important pilgrimages such as Hajj and Umra, being housed within the Sacred Mosque in Mecca.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-fe262a6f9812b90fd703c1e1f0663b6b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3dc7e2b0bdcb5cf6ffad76150023fc3b</data>
