      <data key="d1">geographical_location</data>
      <data key="d2">Harsh desert area within modern Saudi Arabia that reflects the challenging geography of the Arabian Peninsula during the time of early Islamic history.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-3dc7e2b0bdcb5cf6ffad76150023fc3b</data>
