      <data key="d0">united majority of Arab tribes under his leadership</data>
      <data key="d1">historical_concept_or_event</data>
      <data key="d2">Muhammad succeeded in uniting the majority of western Arabian tribes through Islam.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-33708cfaea8613ac13f575367841658f</data>
      <data key="d4">dumps/World_History_Volume_1/pages_content.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1783210962</data>
