      <data key="d1">&lt;"historical_concept_or_event</data>
      <data key="d2">&lt;Entity_description: A series of conflicts that involved significant portions of a population or territory over control and legitimacy within a state. During the Umayyad era, civil war marked the end of Rasidun Caliphate, leading to succession disputes and division.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-eca248d7090f58e7e1c63a9bfb407080</data>
      <data key="d4">dumps/World_History_Volume_1/pages_content.json</data>
