      <data key="d1">civilization_or_empire</data>
      <data key="d2">&lt;The Aksumite Kingdom was a flourishing empire that controlled trade routes in the Red Sea from approximately 100 CE to 940 CE, experiencing its greatest extent under King Ezna but declined by 600 CE.&gt;</data>
