      <data key="d1">historical_figure</data>
      <data key="d2">&lt;King ZabulShah led Aksumite forces and managed to repel the Persians, driving them out of the Arabian Peninsula after the fall of the Sasanid Empire in the mid-6th century.&gt;</data>
