      <data key="d1">historical_event</data>
      <data key="d2">&lt;The Aksumite Kingdom declined due to deforestation, resource depletion, internal rebellions, and external pressures from Arab expansion after the fall of the Sasanid Empire in 571 CE.&gt;</data>
