      <data key="d0">&lt;Ethiopian territories&gt;</data>
      <data key="d1">geographical_location</data>
      <data key="d2">&lt;After the decline of the Aksumite Kingdom, Ethiopian regions absorbed part of its power centers, transforming into broader regional structures with mixed cultural and political identities.&gt;</data>
