      <data key="d1">historical_concept_or_event</data>
      <data key="d2">&lt;The transformation from inland Aksum to port-based settlements was a significant shift due to environmental and economic factors, leading the rise of major trading centers like Manda and Shang on the Swahili Coast.&gt;</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-6ea12f4a3376daf41b860db682d4f0a3</data>
