      <data key="d0">Kharijites</data>
      <data key="d1">cultural_or_religious_movement</data>
      <data key="d2">The Kharijites are a group of Muslim dissenters who played an early role in trade networks on the Swahili Coast, primarily located in Oman and parts of East Africa.</data>
