    <node id="&lt;Great Zimbabwe&gt;">
      <data key="d0">&lt;Great Zimbabwe&gt;</data>
      <data key="d1">geographical_location</data>
      <data key="d2">Great Zimbabwe was a major Bantu city-state in southeastern Africa during the medieval period, known for its impressive石刻建筑, economic power, and strategic location between the interior of Africa and the Indian Ocean trade network.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-6fbcde17381f5e9dee30a651c33fb9e9</data>
