      <data key="d0">Three Kingdoms period</data>
      <data key="d1">time_period</data>
      <data key="d2">"The Three Kingdoms period spans from 313 BCE to 668 CE.&lt;Figure 12.26 shows Korea during this period with the three kingdoms-Baekje, Silla, and Goguryeo.",</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-464eb2e1546acfe2e39b57d49cd04088</data>
