      <data key="d1">historical_concept_or_event</data>
      <data key="d2">Lady Aoi is a significant character in the classic Japanese novel "The Tale of Genji." She plays roles both in courtly drama and funeral rituals, illustrating her importance within the narrative. The funeral scene in particular underscores her significance and contributes to the work's cultural importance. Throughout the text, Lady Aoi serves as an integral figure whose story adds depth to the Court life depicted in the novel.</data>
