      <data key="d1">&lt;time_period&gt;</data>
      <data key="d2">A time period in Japanese history from 794 to 1185, characterized by the rule of the Imperial court in Kyoto. It marked a transition from centralized administration to regional military power, leading to the rise of samurai warriors.</data>
