      <data key="d1">&lt;historical_concept_or_event&gt;</data>
      <data key="d2">Refers to the governmental system and practices of the Japanese imperial court before the Heian period, which began weakening by the mid-to-late 11th century, allowing regional armed families to gain influence.</data>
