    <node id="Tang Emperor Wuzong Persecution of Buddhists">
      <data key="d0">Tang Emperor Wuzong Persecution of Buddhists</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">"The persecution of Buddhist monks and nuns by Tang Emperor Wuzong was driven by his belief that Buddhism threatened the Confucian state and imperial order." )</data>
