    <node id="Visigoths'">
      <data key="d0">Visigoths'</data>
      <data key="d1">historical_figure_or_group</data>
      <data key="d2">The Visigoths' conversion to Christianity had significant impacts on their relations with Jewish people, a topic of discussion in the second question.</data>
