    <node id="Sufism">
      <data key="d0">Sufism</data>
      <data key="d1">mystical Islamic tradition</data>
      <data key="d2">Sufism, identified as a religious movement within Islam, is characterized by its emphasis on spiritual union with God and inner personal contemplation. This movement rejected the worldly aspects of other imperial systems, focusing instead on achieving a deeper, more intimate relationship with the divine through mystical practices and introspection.</data>
