    <node id="Holy Sepulchre">
      <data key="d0">Holy Sepulchre</data>
      <data key="d1">cultural_or_religious_movement</data>
      <data key="d2">The Holy Sepulchre is a site of great importance for Christians in Jerusalem, representing a key location for pilgrimage and devotion. This sacred structure holds significant historical value as it is believed to be the resting place of Jesus Christ, according to biblical accounts. During the Crusading Movement, the Holy Sepulchre served as a crucial focal point, driving much of the stated goals and justifications behind these campaigns.</data>
