      <data key="d1">&lt;"source_or_artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">&lt;"The Treaty of Jaffa was a peace agreement signed between Frederick II and Sultan al-Kamil in 1219. It settled the conflict between the two powers and marked an important moment in the history of the crusades."</data>
