    <node id="Treaty of Jaffa">
      <data key="d0">Treaty of Jaffa</data>
      <data key="d1">historical_concept_or_event</data>
      <data key="d2">The Treaty of Jaffa was a significant historical event signed between Al-Kamil and Frederick II in 1229 AD. This treaty granted Frederick the title of king of Jerusalem, albeit with limited power, establishing a complex dynamic that likely intertwines Christian and Muslim interactions during this period.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-fcb1c0aa30537ed564041e3f6b9c2246&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bbaccac96c9ea8e056f368393c0b33b3</data>
