      <data key="d0">Crusader morale</data>
      <data key="d1">historical_concept_or_event</data>
      <data key="d2">Frederick’s negotiation policy undermined crusader morale, leading to mistrust among Holy Land Christians and sapping their will to fight.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-fcb1c0aa30537ed564041e3f6b9c2246</data>
      <data key="d4">dumps/World_History_Volume_1/pages_content.json</data>
