    <node id="Almohad dynasty">
      <data key="d0">Almohad dynasty</data>
      <data key="d1">civilization_or_empire</data>
      <data key="d2">The Almohad dynasty governed parts of North Africa and Iberia, known for their religious reforms and military campaigns against Christian kingdoms in the 12th century.</data>
