      <data key="d0">Ayyubids_and_Mamluks_repelling_crusades</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">The Ayyubid and Mamluk leaders successfully repelled several Crusader invasions in the early 13th century, contributing to the decline of Crusader states in the Levant.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-7083273cf1feba343b800d63e994ddde</data>
