      <data key="d0">early twentieth-century photography</data>
      <data key="d1">source_or_artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">"An early twentieth-century photograph shows a caravan of camels laden with sixty-pound slabs of salt crossing the Sahara near Timbuktu, highlighting the historical significance of salt transport in West Africa.")&lt;|</data>
