      <data key="d1">&lt;"civilization_or_empire"&gt;</data>
      <data key="d2">&lt;"The Great Zimbabwe culture was a civilization that thrived in southern Africa between approximately 11th to 15th centuries. It is known for its impressive stone architecture, advanced infrastructure, and trade networks.")</data>
