      <data key="d1">&lt;"source_or_artifact"&gt;</data>
      <data key="d2">&lt;"Alexandria was a significant ancient Egyptian city that served as an important intellectual and cultural hub in the early Christian era, known for its famous Library and later its churches. It played a crucial role in preserving and spreading early Christian texts and teachings."&gt;</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-9885f9e0c1965c95ff90139b9fdaedf2</data>
