      <data key="d1">&lt;"historical_concept_or_event"&gt;</data>
      <data key="d2">&lt;"The period of Emperor Diocletian's rule, from 284 to 305 AD, was marked by significant changes in Roman governance, including the introduction of tetrarchy and increased persecution of Christians."&gt;</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-9885f9e0c1965c95ff90139b9fdaedf2</data>
