      <data key="d1">&lt;"cultural_or_religious_movement"&gt;</data>
      <data key="d2">&lt;"During Emperor Diocletian's reign, many early Christian followers sought refuge in the western deserts of Egypt. This led to the development of a network of religious communities or monastic settlements that helped preserve Christianity during periods of Roman persecution."&gt;</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-9885f9e0c1965c95ff90139b9fdaedf2</data>
