      <data key="d0">Islamic Caliphate</data>
      <data key="d1">civilization_or_empire</data>
      <data key="d2">The Islamic state ruled by a caliph during this period that expanded its influence through conquests and cultural movements in North Africa and beyond.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-70d03803311b31d7e11f7ace07e0a57f</data>
