      <data key="d0">&lt;"slavery"</data>
      <data key="d1">&lt;historical_concept_or_event&gt;</data>
      <data key="d2">&lt;"The Ghana Empire also benefited from slave raids, which contributed significantly to its wealth alongside gold and copper taxes."&lt;|</data>
