      <data key="d1">&lt;source_or_artifact&gt;</data>
      <data key="d2">&lt;"This work by Al-Bakri in 1067–1068 provides valuable insights into the Ghana Empire, including information on the king’s town, wealth distribution, infrastructure, and cultural details."&lt;|</data>
