    <node id="Mediterranean coast">
      <data key="d0">Mediterranean coast</data>
      <data key="d1">geographical_location</data>
      <data key="d2">The Mediterranean coast is the shoreline bordering the Mediterranean Sea that stretches from Europe to North Africa. It has been a key region for historical movements such as the spread of Islam, trade routes, and cultural exchanges between different civilizations.</data>
