      <data key="d1">cultural_or_religious_movement</data>
      <data key="d2">"&lt;description&gt;"The influence of Confucian principles in the Mongol governmental organization during the Yuan Dynasty, which sought to maintain cultural separation from their Chinese subjects."</data>
