      <data key="d0">Granaries and Relief Policies of the Mongols</data>
      <data key="d1">historical_concept_or_event</data>
      <data key="d2">"&lt;description&gt;"The benevolent policies introduced by Yuan rulers, including relief granaries, forgiveness of tax burdens in disaster-affected areas, and reductions in capital punishment that alleviated hardships for many subjects."</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-6259dc7dab010ce384b0b2df8038b744</data>
