      <data key="d1">historical_concept_or_event</data>
      <data key="d2">The Mongol rule over China during the Yuan Dynasty marked a distinct period of governance that had significant impacts on Chinese culture and society.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-d85eeeedc638b2dc40a70eec24196c37</data>
