    <node id="crusades">
      <data key="d0">crusades</data>
      <data key="d1">historical_concept_or_event</data>
      <data key="d2">The Crusades were a series of religious conflicts and wars initiated by Western Christian monarchs, with involvement primarily from Western Europe. These military campaigns were undertaken with the goal of reclaiming Jerusalem and the Holy Land for Christendom from Muslim rule. The primary objective was to regain control over sacred sites and territories considered crucial to Christianity.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-51a6e6c0f619a3b37e3ee2a7e7f19b5a</data>
