      <data key="d1">civilization_or_empire</data>
      <data key="d2">The Persian Mongol Jalayir dynasty was an empire that lost territories to Timur, influencing his territorial ambitions.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-325c2f087ce183f26e739c5d7d7a119e</data>
