      <data key="d0">Byzantines</data>
      <data key="d1">cultural_or_religious_movement</data>
      <data key="d2">The Byzantine Empire was a Christian state based in Constantinople (modern-day Istanbul). It formed an alliance with Timur against common enemies like the Ottomans.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-325c2f087ce183f26e739c5d7d7a119e</data>
