    <node id="Registan">
      <data key="d0">Registan</data>
      <data key="d1">geographical_location</data>
      <data key="d2">Registan is an area in Samarkand, known in Persian as 'country of sand,' serving as a public square and center for learning.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-0e02f2af9c7712235155281a18fd34d7</data>
