    <node id="Timar System">
      <data key="d0">Timar System</data>
      <data key="d1">cultural_or_religious_movement</data>
      <data key="d2">The timar system awarded rights to collect taxes based on merit within the Ottoman realm, often given to cavalry members and other elite individuals regardless of religion or ethnicity.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-0e02f2af9c7712235155281a18fd34d7</data>
