      <data key="d0">Fatih Complex</data>
      <data key="d1">geographical_location</data>
      <data key="d2">The Fatih Mosque is part of the Fatih Complex, which also includes other educational institutions like madrasas.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b67f0f7afc2d163b11e5f62d24179b37</data>
