      <data key="d0">Kanun-name</data>
      <data key="d1">source_or_artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">The Kanun-name, or 'Book of the Law', is an artifact comprising compiled kanuns issued by Sultan Mehmed II.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-8adac32853d2cbcb9cfc409ace493450</data>
      <data key="d4">dumps/World_History_Volume_1/pages_content.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1783211028</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Ottoman states control">
      <data key="d0">Ottoman states control</data>
      <data key="d1">historical_concept_or_event</data>
      <data key="d2">With the fall of Byzantine Empire and Timurid authority, Ottoman state could now act as a gatekeeper between East and West, asserting its broader control.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-8adac32853d2cbcb9cfc409ace493450</data>
      <data key="d4">dumps/World_History_Volume_1/pages_content.json</data>
