      <data key="d1">source_or_artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">Trinity with the Virgin, Saint John the Evangelist, and Donors is a fresco created around 1427 that showcases the use of linear perspective.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-bf5cfe6916b81abc088c0896d934f008</data>
      <data key="d4">dumps/World_History_Volume_1/pages_content.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1783211030</data>
