      <data key="d0">&lt;Athens&gt;</data>
      <data key="d1">&lt;geographical_location&gt;</data>
      <data key="d2">City-state located in Greece, renowned for its democracy and significant contributions to the arts, philosophy, and architecture.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-dc1872cdee420d862b70822163485b6f</data>
