      <data key="d3">chunk-cd9c7f6e58d53fe2d7895baaf718081c</data>
      <data key="d2">The defensive wall with watchtowers that surrounded the central complex at Cahokia demonstrated organized societal structures and protection mechanisms of the urban center.</data>
