      <data key="d3">chunk-c30d8b2342ab7e0a7d4403aa83d331e1</data>
      <data key="d2">The third millennium BCE marks the early adoption of agriculture, which provided a foundation for later agricultural developments like those seen in Mesoamerica.</data>
