    <node id="Theodosius_I">
      <data key="d0">Theodosius_I</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-fa8b96093ad85d351d71a70ae72eb655</data>
      <data key="d2">Although not specifically mentioned, Theodosius II's establishment of the Theodosian Code followed in a line of emperors using councils and laws to address theological issues. His activities are representative of this theme.</data>
      <data key="d1">UNKNOWN</data>
      <data key="d4">dumps/World_History_Volume_1/pages_content.json</data>
      <data key="d5">1783203325</data>
