      <data key="d0">Stilicho</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-e8b93582db5d7a873cf44814a77997d9</data>
      <data key="d2">Stilicho, a Roman military commander of Vandal origin, played a significant role in shaping the political landscape during this period as he sought control over the western empire. His actions directly influenced the power dynamics within the Roman territories.</data>
      <data key="d1">UNKNOWN</data>
      <data key="d4">dumps/World_History_Volume_1/pages_content.json</data>
