      <data key="d3">chunk-0f3483082d977617409e75f5948382d4</data>
      <data key="d2">&lt;"'The decline of the Seleucid Empire created a power vacuum that allowed the Parthian Empire, under Parthian leadership, to rise. This illustrates historical conflicts leading to geopolitical shifts."</data>
      <data key="d1">UNKNOWN</data>
