    <node id="&lt;&quot;Sasanians&quot;">
      <data key="d0">&lt;"Sasanians"</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-0f3483082d977617409e75f5948382d4</data>
      <data key="d2">&lt;"'The Sasanian Empire emerged as a successor state to the Parthian Empire, inheriting much of its territory. This transition reflects the evolution and reorganization of power in West Asia."</data>
