      <data key="d3">chunk-0f3483082d977617409e75f5948382d4</data>
      <data key="d2">&lt;"'Ardashir I founded the Sassanid Empire, which became a major world power. His conquests and policies set the stage for Sasanian dominance in Iran."</data>
