      <data key="d3">chunk-b8ad3f8265df80ff0cbd95a7914a6123</data>
      <data key="d2">During the periods mentioned, there may have been cross-cultural interactions and influences where Hinduism's cultural practices might have reached across to Yemen through trade networks.&lt;SEP&gt;The Hindu cultural and religious practices might have spread to the Yemeni area through trade networks that passed near or through Adulis, involving interactions along these routes.</data>
