      <data key="d3">chunk-b8ad3f8265df80ff0cbd95a7914a6123</data>
      <data key="d2">Aksum played a role in broader trade networks, including those that later formed parts of the Silk Roads.&lt;SEP&gt;Aksum's wealth allowed it to participate in long-distance trade, contributing goods and services that could have supported the broader Silk Roads network.</data>
