      <data key="d3">chunk-b8ad3f8265df80ff0cbd95a7914a6123</data>
      <data key="d2">The trade routes operated by Aksum, including those through Adulis and along the Red Sea, were integral parts of the broader Silk Roads network, facilitating not only goods but also cultural exchanges.</data>
