      <data key="d2">These philosophers engaged in direct or indirect responses to Byzantine scholars, developing their ideas to counteract foreign influences. Their works show a clear intent to differentiate Islamic philosophy from Greco-Roman traditions.</data>
      <data key="d1">UNKNOWN</data>
