      <data key="d3">chunk-7a54827dcff91e0c3be7735cbd32331f</data>
      <data key="d2">The Battle of Nicopolis was won by the Ottoman army and featured in a 1523 painted miniature.</data>
      <data key="d1">UNKNOWN</data>
