    <edge source="Renaissance" target="Ottoman Control Overland and Maritime Silk Routes">
      <data key="d6">8.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The expansion of Ottoman control over these routes pushed European traders towards maritime exploration, coinciding with the cultural and intellectual rebirth known as the Renaissance.</data>
