    <edge source="Renaissance" target="Trade Routes and European Response">
      <data key="d6">8.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The shift to maritime trade routes was facilitated by the cultural and intellectual momentum of the Renaissance, which embraced exploration and new economic opportunities.</data>
