    <edge source="Renaissance" target="Knowledge Transfer During Renaissance">
      <data key="d6">10.0</data>
      <data key="d7">During the Renaissance, there was a significant influx of classical knowledge from Byzantine scholars, enhancing the cultural and intellectual focus of the Renaissance in areas such as art, literature, and philosophy.</data>
