    <edge source="Ancient Egypt" target="Hieroglyphics">
      <data key="d6">8.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Hieroglyphics played a significant role in Ancient Egyptian civilization, capturing their stories, beliefs, and governance. They often adorned the walls of pyramids.</data>
