    <edge source="Ancient Egypt" target="Neolithic Revolution">
      <data key="d6">16.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The technological advancements of the Neolithic Revolution provided essential agricultural knowledge that allowed for the establishment of permanent settlements along the fertile river valley, facilitating the growth and development of Ancient Egyptian civilization.</data>
