    </edge>
    <edge source="Climate Change" target="1500-1000 BCE">
      <data key="d6">6.0</data>
      <data key="d7">While not directly attested, climate change could be a potential external factor that combined with other environmental issues to contribute to the decline of the Indus Valley Civilization during this time period.</data>
      <data key="d8">external_factors,historical_debate_contemporary</data>
