    <edge source="Paleolithic Art" target="Altamira Cave">
      <data key="d6">10.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Some of the most significant examples of Paleolithic Art were found within Altamira Cave, showcasing detailed paintings and other artistic expressions.</data>
