    <edge source="Cave Paintings" target="Venus Figurines">
      <data key="d6">8.0</data>
      <data key="d7">While Cave Paintings often depicted animals, Venus Figurines are distinct sculptures representing women, believed to be symbols of fertility in Paleolithic culture.</data>
      <data key="d8">Symbols and Art Forms</data>
