    </edge>
    <edge source="Byzantine Empire" target="620s and 630s">
      <data key="d6">14.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The Byzantine Empire was another key target during this period, seen as a rich resource area and potential adversary.</data>
      <data key="d8">expansion,resources</data>
