      <data key="d6">18.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Constantinople was often in conflict with the crusaders during various times in its history.</data>
      <data key="d8">historical context,religious conflict</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-51a6e6c0f619a3b37e3ee2a7e7f19b5a</data>
      <data key="d10">dumps/World_History_Volume_1/pages_content.json</data>
