    <edge source="&lt;Ötzi&gt;" target="&lt;Bearskin cap&gt;">
      <data key="d6">8.2</data>
      <data key="d7">Bearskin caps were part of Ötzi’s attire, indicating their use among the late Neolithic populations as well as earlier cultures.</data>
