    <edge source="&lt;Clothing&gt;" target="&lt;Shoes&gt;">
      <data key="d6">8.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Both leggings and shoes are essential parts of clothing in the Paleolithic Age, showing a comprehensive approach to warmth and protection.</data>
      <data key="d8">Comprehensive_protection</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-959d0e5d4763f5423c8c6e422ec0cdb2</data>
