    </edge>
    <edge source="&lt;Deerskin and bark lined shoes&gt;" target="&lt;Saltwater marine life&gt;">
      <data key="d6">7.4</data>
      <data key="d7">Similarly, utilizing both freshwater and saltwater resources reflects the adaptability of paleolithic people to diverse environments.</data>
