    </edge>
    <edge source="Sumer" target="geographical_location">
      <data key="d6">14.0</data>
      <data key="d7">"Sumer was located within the broader region of Mesopotamia, which contributed to its cultural, economic, and technological development. The geographical setting influenced the emergence of cuneiform script and other innovations."|</data>
      <data key="d8">"civilization-location"|</data>
