    </edge>
    <edge source="Art of Ur Box" target="Specialization of Labor">
      <data key="d6">8.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The creation of the Art of Ur box demonstrates evidence of specialized labor in Sumerian society.</data>
      <data key="d8">Artifacts,Craftsmanship</data>
