      <data key="d6">6.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The Tower of Jericho exemplifies the kind of structured works created during the Neolithic era, representing a milestone in architecture and societal development.</data>
      <data key="d8">artifact-era</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-00b045edff27a3849cb01d2c87c94a5f</data>
