    </edge>
    <edge source="Tower of Jericho" target="Cultural Or Religious Movement'&lt; Work">
      <data key="d6">6.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The construction of the Tower of Jericho suggests complex cultural or religious movements during the Neolithic era when societies were developing new practices and beliefs.</data>
      <data key="d8">architecture-belief</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-00b045edff27a3849cb01d2c87c94a5f</data>
      <data key="d10">dumps/World_History_Volume_1/pages_content.json</data>
