    <edge source="Irrigation Canals" target="Urban Planning">
      <data key="d6">10.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The development of irrigation canals was closely intertwined with urban planning to ensure that water resources were effectively managed, supporting the growth of cities in the Mesopotamian region.</data>
      <data key="d8">infrastructure_design</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-4475a92fdbe351d1be51fc471c84fa37</data>
