    <edge source="Neolithic Revolution" target="historical_concept_or_event">
      <data key="d6">8.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The Neolithic period marked the transition from hunter-gatherer societies to agricultural ones, establishing permanent settlements.&lt;"|&gt;agricultural revolution, sedentary life, farming</data>
      <data key="d8">4</data>
