    <edge source="Neolithic Revolution" target="Nile River Valley, Lower Egypt, Upper Egypt">
      <data key="d6">14.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The agricultural techniques and advancements from the Neolithic period allowed the Nile valley societies to develop more complex social structures beyond those of hunter-gatherer communities.</data>
      <data key="d8">Civilization Development,Technological Advancements</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-038356ebaf9b5df91192c77bd51ac651</data>
