    <edge source="First Empire Era" target="Akkadian Empire">
      <data key="d6">18.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The Akkadian Empire was an empire that emerged and thrived during the First Empire Era, a period marked by its significant rise and expansive growth. This era saw the crucial development and outward expansion of the Akkadian Empire, consolidating its power and影响力。请注意，我将“Akka迪亚帝国”翻译为了“Akkadian Empire”，假设这是笔误，并进行了纠正以确保描述的准确性。如果你指的是其他内容，请提供更多信息以便进行准确翻译。</data>
