    <edge source="Iron Age" target="Assyrian Empire">
      <data key="d6">10.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The Assyrian Empire rose and thrived during the Iron Age, marking a significant period of its expansion and consolidation. The technologies and social changes associated with the Iron Age enabled the empire's rise to power.</data>
      <data key="d8">empire-rise-during-iron-age</data>
