    <edge source="Iron Age" target="Stone Relief from an Assyrian Palace">
      <data key="d6">6.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The stone relief is a cultural artifact of the Iron Age, documenting the artistic and architectural advancements during this period in Mesopotamia. It provides insight into the socio-political and religious life of the Empire under Ashurbanipal.</data>
      <data key="d8">cultural-advancements-artifacts</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-23d1e6b89ed34f781b195088854edaee</data>
