      <data key="d6">8.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The Eighth Avenue Post Office displays an inscription inspired by the Persian Empire's courier system, paying homage to its historical significance. This relationship reflects a modern acknowledgment of antiquity in postal service operations.</data>
