    <edge source="&lt;Ahura Mazda&gt;" target="&lt;Zoroastrianism&gt;">
      <data key="d6">14.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Ahura Mazda is the primary deity in Zoroastrianism, representing good and wisdom. Depicted prominently in imagery like those found at Persepolis.</data>
      <data key="d8">primary_deity</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-2e05c323f2387cfb1c337fb65115e181</data>
