      <data key="d11">1783211053</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&lt;Ahura Mazda&gt;" target="&lt;Persia&gt;">
      <data key="d6">14.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Ahura Mazda's depictions are associated with Persia, as evidenced by his prominent image at Persepolis, symbolizing the religious and cultural significance of this deity in Persian history.</data>
      <data key="d8">depiction_location</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-2e05c323f2387cfb1c337fb65115e181</data>
