    </edge>
    <edge source="&lt;KingAgamemnonofMycenae&gt;" target="&lt;trojanWar&gt;">
      <data key="d6">8.0</data>
      <data key="d7">According to legend, King Agamemnon led Achaean forces in the Trojan War against Troy.</data>
