    </edge>
    <edge source="&lt;TheCollapseoftheBronzeAgeWorld&gt;" target="&lt;DarkAgeinGreece&gt;">
      <data key="d6">10.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The fall of Bronze Age civilizations led to the Dark Ages in Greece, a period of cultural decline.</data>
      <data key="d8">decline_period_causal</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-31f3de74d24f9f5ce534259a76865d74</data>
