    </edge>
    <edge source="Egyptian Sculpture" target="Cleopatra statue">
      <data key="d6">8.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The Cleopatra statue demonstrates the early influence of Egyptian sculpture on Greek artistic practices, sharing conventions such as arms close to the body and parallel feet.</data>
