    </edge>
    <edge source="Cleopatra statue" target="Kouros">
      <data key="d6">10.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Both the Cleopatra statue and Kouros share similar artistic poses and stances, indicating a continuity of sculptural traditions from Egypt to Greece.</data>
