    <edge source="Alexander the Great's conquests" target="historical_concept_or_event">
      <data key="d6">12.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The conquering actions of Alexander the Great directly led to the spread of Greek culture through the Mediterranean and Near East regions during the Hellenistic period.</data>
