    <edge source="Conquests of Alexander the Great" target="Battle of Gaugamela">
      <data key="d6">18.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The victory at the Battle of Gaugamela was a key factor that enabled Alexander's extensive conquests, including the destruction of Persepolis.</data>
