    <edge source="&lt;historical_figure&gt;" target="&lt;cultural_or_religious_movement&gt;">
      <data key="d6">4.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Cleopatra VII's association with Egyptian symbolism, particularly as a pharaoh-like figure, connects her to cultural and religious movements in Egypt during this period.</data>
      <data key="d8">symbolism_influence</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-5914a1bc816edf3338d898be6d68146b</data>
