      <data key="d6">14.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Shows how power was distributed between men and women, with males holding ultimate authority but females also having responsibilities and social roles to fulfill.</data>
      <data key="d8">authority,family structure,gender_roles</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-4d0065dafd1255d4e61e9e62d929b1b6</data>
      <data key="d10">dumps/World_History_Volume_1/pages_content.json</data>
