    <edge source="Vestal Virgins" target="Yam System">
      <data key="d6">6.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The Vestal Virgins did not directly relate to the yam system on the surface, but together they represent the organizational structure of different ancient Roman and Mongol systems that managed social and religious responsibilities. This relationship is more thematic than direct functional interconnection.</data>
      <data key="d8">organization,societal roles</data>
