      <data key="d6">8.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Earthen work structure built around 6500 BCE that represents early human habitation and cultural practices in the Eastern region of North America.</data>
      <data key="d8">settlements</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-5e3db4c8c682179f5b74acdaf61f0d4f</data>
