    <edge source="Natural Migration Path" target="Early American Migrants">
      <data key="d6">6.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The migration path facilitated by the Andes passageway enabled early American migrants to spread down the western side of South America, reaching as far south as southern Chile and possibly beyond.</data>
      <data key="d8">migration,settlement</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-b57294b6404d0e2e6323ef615e064cfc</data>
