    </edge>
    <edge source="Modified Bone and Antler" target="Textiles">
      <data key="d6">10.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Both bone tools and textiles suggest a range of survival skills, including tool-making and early weaving techniques practiced at Guitarrero Cave.</data>
      <data key="d8">toolmaking_weaving</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-b57294b6404d0e2e6323ef615e064cfc</data>
