    <edge source="Olmec Civilization" target="San Lorenzo (Site)">
      <data key="d6">8.0</data>
      <data key="d7">San Lorenzo represents a key event marking the beginning and development of the Olmec civilization with large architectural projects in Mesoamerica.</data>
