      <data key="d11">1783211067</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Monte Albán" target="influenced by Teotihuacán">
      <data key="d6">2.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The city of Monte Albán was affected by cultural and military influences from Teotihuacán, despite serving as a capital of an older civilization.</data>
      <data key="d8">cultural influence,military influence</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-03a15d067f74707fd348b5bcb5e978e7</data>
      <data key="d10">dumps/World_History_Volume_1/pages_content.json</data>
      <data key="d11">1783211067</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&lt;geographical_location&gt;" target="&lt;Samarra&gt;">
      <data key="d6">10.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Mamluks were segregated in Samarra, showing the distinct social hierarchy present in the Abbasid Caliphate. This segregation was a reflection of Al-Mutasim's policies and his effort to maintain order.</data>
      <data key="d8">segregation</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-a51f56123d8110f2ea915388f363a913</data>
      <data key="d10">dumps/World_History_Volume_1/pages_content.json</data>
      <data key="d11">1783211085</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&lt;Teotihuacán&gt;" target="&lt;Pyramid_of_the_Sun&gt;">
      <data key="d6">8.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Construction of a monumental pyramid structure that exemplifies architectural accomplishment and religious symbolism.</data>
      <data key="d8">Architecture/Religion</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-4083e7ff876dd54b2e91d37d47639816</data>
      <data key="d10">dumps/World_History_Volume_1/pages_content.json</data>
      <data key="d11">1783211067</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&lt;Teotihuacán&gt;" target="&lt;Pyramid_of_the_Moon&gt;">
      <data key="d6">6.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Second major architectural feat, complementing the Pyramid of the Sun and further highlighting the city's engineering prowess and cultural practices.</data>
      <data key="d8">Architecture/Religion</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-4083e7ff876dd54b2e91d37d47639816</data>
      <data key="d10">dumps/World_History_Volume_1/pages_content.json</data>
      <data key="d11">1783211067</data>
    </edge>
