      <data key="d11">1783211067</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Maya Writing System" target="Classic Maya Civilization">
      <data key="d6">8.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The decoding of the Maya writing system provides insights into the cultural history and societal structure of Classic Maya civilization, offering a means to understand its decline.</data>
      <data key="d8">Decoding Insights</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-733f0173d74970851253f094a6529a69</data>
      <data key="d10">dumps/World_History_Volume_1/pages_content.json</data>
      <data key="d11">1783211067</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Collapse of Classic Maya Civilization" target="Yucatán Peninsula">
      <data key="d6">6.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Following the collapse of Classic Maya cities, the Yucatán area saw a resurgence in Maya civilization that continued through the sixteenth century despite the societal upheaval north of it.</data>
      <data key="d8">Renaissance After Collapse</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-733f0173d74970851253f094a6529a69</data>
      <data key="d10">dumps/World_History_Volume_1/pages_content.json</data>
      <data key="d11">1783211067</data>
    </edge>
