    </edge>
    <edge source="Moche civilization" target="Tiwanaku civilization">
      <data key="d6">6.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The Tiwanaku civilization influenced Moche society through cultural exchanges, possibly sharing advancements in agriculture or art, thus reflecting overlaps in their geographical influence areas around 100 CE.</data>
      <data key="d8">cultural exchange,influence</data>
