      <data key="d6">6.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Tiwanaku civilization flourished in the region around Lake Titicaca during their period of sustained building (100 CE), indicating geographical proximity and cultural ties.</data>
      <data key="d8">proximity_and_cultural_ties</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-3ab2455895eb8921de59c456fa3781d0</data>
