      <data key="d6">6.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Both are significant sites in pre-Hispanic Mesoamerican history, representing different time periods and cultures but sharing regional importance. Casas Grandes may have had interactions with Lake Texcoco through trade or cultural exchange.</data>
