    </edge>
    <edge source="Lake Texcoco" target="Aztlan">
      <data key="d6">4.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Both are important in the history and mythology of the Aztecs, though Aztlan is considered a mythical homeland while Lake Texcoco was an actual geographical site. They share a historical and cultural significance to the Aztec people.</data>
      <data key="d8">Mythical-Real Connections</data>
