    </edge>
    <edge source="Tribute system" target="Long-distance trade">
      <data key="d6">2.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Both systems coexisted within Cahokian society; trade facilitated the acquisition of goods for tribute, while the latter enforced economic dependence.</data>
