    <edge source="Third Millennium BCE" target="Maize Agriculture in Mesoamerica">
      <data key="d6">8.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The third millennium BCE marks the early adoption of agriculture, which provided a foundation for later agricultural developments like those seen in Mesoamerica.</data>
