      <data key="d11">1783211070</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Maya city-states" target="complex writing system">
      <data key="d6">16.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The Maya developed one of the most sophisticated writing systems in pre-Columbian Americas, which included both logographic and syllabic elements. This innovation influenced later Mesoamerican cultures including those that emerged from the Maya decline.</data>
      <data key="d8">influence,writing</data>
