    <edge source="&lt;&quot;9.2 The Emergence of Farming and the Bantu Migrations&quot;&gt;" target="Fertile Crescent geographical_location">
      <data key="d6">8.0</data>
      <data key="d7">(The origins of agriculture are linked to this region before spreading to Africa.)</data>
