    </edge>
    <edge source="Common Cultural Foundation" target="Iron Metallurgy">
      <data key="d6">2.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Iron metallurgy played a crucial role in laying the common cultural foundation throughout southern Africa.</data>
      <data key="d8">"cultural_connectivity"&lt;?|&gt;&lt;2&gt;</data>
