    <edge source="Bantu Migrations" target="weather_patterns_shifts">
      <data key="d6">16.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The gradual change in weather patterns played a key role in enabling Bantu migrations from their original region into different parts of sub-Saharan Africa.</data>
      <data key="d8">migration_and_climate_changes</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-171b3e11780c09f4c082d1fcb308f43d</data>
      <data key="d10">dumps/World_History_Volume_1/pages_content.json</data>
