      <data key="d6">2.0</data>
      <data key="d7">&lt;"The establishment of this kingdom signified the consolidation of power by the Kushites, solidifying their hold on both Nubia and Egypt under a new dynastic rule."&gt;</data>
      <data key="d8">&lt;"State Formation; Dynastic Rule"&gt;</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-b13ca3c5039a592c7efe58cadf289401</data>
