      <data key="d6">2.0</data>
      <data key="d7">&lt;"By aligning religious figures with the state, Piye’s actions facilitated a smoother transition and acceptance of Kushite rule over Egypt."&gt;</data>
      <data key="d8">&lt;"Religious Strategy; Political Reconciliation"&gt;</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-b13ca3c5039a592c7efe58cadf289401</data>
