    <edge source="Edict on Maximum Prices" target="reform">
      <data key="d6">14.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Diocletian issued the Edict on Maximum Prices as part of a series of reforms aimed at curbing inflation and supporting trade within the empire.</data>
