    <edge source="&lt;Constantinople&gt;" target="&lt;Rule of Roman Christianity&gt;">
      <data key="d6">16.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Constantinople served as the capital for the period when Christian governance and institutions flourished under Constantine's successors.</data>
      <data key="d8">capital city</data>
