    </edge>
    <edge source="&lt;Constantinople&gt;" target="&lt;Sasanians&gt;">
      <data key="d6">14.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Constantinople served as a focal point for Christian governance, challenging Sasanian control in the Eastern provinces.</data>
      <data key="d8">center of power</data>
