    <edge source="&lt;Edict of Milan&gt;" target="&lt;Christianity&gt;">
      <data key="d6">14.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The edict promoted religious freedom for Christians, aiding in the spread and status of Christianity within the Roman Empire.</data>
