    <edge source="&lt;Christianity&gt;" target="&lt;Ecumenical Councils&gt;">
      <data key="d6">12.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Ecumenical councils convened to standardize Christian teachings and practices, supporting the growth of Christianity under imperial protection.</data>
