    <edge source="&lt;Ctesiphon&gt;" target="&lt;Sasanians&gt;">
      <data key="d6">14.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Ctesiphon was a site of conflict with Sasanians, highlighting the geopolitical tensions between Christian Rome and its Eastern enemies during Julian's reign.</data>
