    <edge source="&lt;Rule of Roman Christianity&gt;" target="&lt;Mortal Wound&gt;">
      <data key="d6">16.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The mort wound of Julian marked the end of a period where paganism was briefly revived, signaling the permanent shift to Christian dominance.</data>
