    <edge source="emperors" target="Theodosius_I">
      <data key="d6">2.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Although not specifically mentioned, Theodosius II's establishment of the Theodosian Code followed in a line of emperors using councils and laws to address theological issues. His activities are representative of this theme.</data>
