    <edge source="Constantinople" target="Ottoman Empire">
      <data key="d6">30.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Constantinople, the strategic city, was a primary target for expansion by the Ottoman Empire during its quest for territorial growth. This objective was underpinned by the efforts of Mehmed II, who led the Ottoman forces in the historic siege of Constantinople that ultimately lasted until 1453.</data>
