      <data key="d6">4.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Queen Radegund founded a monastery that exemplifies the significant roles monasteries played in the medieval period as centers for education, piety, and preservation of knowledge. Her influence as a religious leader is underscored by her dedication to piety and education, highlighting the important contributions of influential women like herself in the formation and operation of monastic communities during this era.</data>
