    </edge>
    <edge source="Timur" target="destroyed_Delhi">
      <data key="d6">14.0</data>
      <data key="d7">"Following the destruction of Delhi in 1398, Timur established a significant strategic position in India, expanding his empire’s influence.")</data>
      <data key="d8">empire_expansion</data>
