    <edge source="Adoption of Gunpowder" target="Technological Changes">
      <data key="d6">20.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The adoption of gunpowder serves as a key example of technological change with immense historical impact. This innovation played a pivotal role in shaping military development, as well as influencing various aspects of society. The adoption of gunpowder is specifically cited to connect the broader concept of technological change to its concrete application and consequences in historical contexts. The relationship between these concepts highlights how advancements like gunpowder significantly transformed warfare and had far-reaching implications beyond just military strategies.</data>
      <data key="d8">historical event,military impact,military strategy,significant event,technological change,technology</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-f3acbd758cf8087488127fa375dda8fa</data>
