    <edge source="Tudors" target="Athens, Ancient Greece">
      <data key="d6">2.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Comparisons are often made between the Tudor period's political structure and that of ancient Athens, particularly in discussions about governance and democracy. Both cover themes of lawmaking and social order.</data>
