    </edge>
    <edge source="Tudors" target="China, Ancient China">
      <data key="d6">2.0</data>
      <data key="d7">While the Tudor period spans more recent history, comparisons can be made with ancient Chinese dynasties in discussions about royal courts, legal systems, and social structures.</data>
