    </edge>
    <edge source="Tudors" target="Japan, Ancient Japan">
      <data key="d6">2.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Comparisons are also drawn between the Tudor period and ancient Japanese history when discussing governance, legal practices, and societal structure. Both cover themes of royal authority.</data>
