    <edge source="&lt;Assyria&gt;" target="&lt;Greece (Ancient)&gt;">
      <data key="d6">2.0</data>
      <data key="d7">&lt;Both Assyria and Ancient Greece existed during overlapping periods in world history and experienced some level of cultural exchange through trade, although direct interaction is less documented. However, their interactions were indirect but clearly relevant to the broader context of ancient Near Eastern civilizations.</data>
