    <edge source="&lt;Assyria&gt;" target="&lt;Qin Dynasty&gt;">
      <data key="d6">2.0</data>
      <data key="d7">&lt;Both Assyria and the Qin Dynasty experienced large-scale territorial expansion and complex administrative systems, although they operated in different parts of the world. These similarities suggest shared elements of governance and statecraft.</data>
