    <edge source="Eurasian Steppe" target="Inner Asian Steppe">
      <data key="d6">10.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The Inner Asian Steppe is a significant part of the larger Eurasian Steppe, covering the eastern half and characterized by diverse natural landscapes and historical shifts influenced by climate change.</data>
