      <data key="d7">The Romans-Kentake encounter likely took place along the Rome-Egyptian border region as part of the Roman expansion against the Meroitic forces. This interaction was a significant aspect of Roman military campaigns during their period of territorial growth and consolidation in North Africa.</data>
