    <edge source="Roman Empire Shift" target="historical_process">
      <data key="d6">16.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The description of the Roman Empire's shift eastward, marked by its capital relocation to Constantinople, symbolizes the empire's adaptation to new political landscapes and challenges.</data>
