    <edge source="historical_process" target="Internal Changes in Byzantine Empire">
      <data key="d6">14.0</data>
      <data key="d7">This reflects internal transitions within what was once a unified Roman entity but now comprises the independent states of both the Eastern (Byzantine) and potentially fragmented Western regions.</data>
      <data key="d8">empire fragmentation,internal dynamics</data>
