    <edge source="historical_process" target="External Pressures on Byzantine Empire">
      <data key="d6">18.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The mention of external pressures from Germanic tribes, Palmyra, and interactions with Aksum and Kushan empires illustrate the multifaceted influences shaping Byzantine history during this period.</data>
      <data key="d8">cultural exchange,external threats</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-f82fcaeaf8ded7ccd594a70788c5c5e9</data>
