      <data key="d6">2.0</data>
      <data key="d7">&lt;"'Nomadic tribes represented a threat or resource for the Sasanian Empire. Their coexistence with urban centers suggests ongoing social and political dynamics between settled and nomadic groups."</data>
      <data key="d8">&lt; "nomadism within states"</data>
