      <data key="d6">8.0</data>
      <data key="d7">"Both empires engaged in several skirmishes and alliances, reflecting their overlapping territorial aspirations and ideological differences.")</data>
      <data key="d8">conflict,rivalry</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-9cea715d402110c49c739e324bc54567</data>
      <data key="d10">dumps/World_History_Volume_1/pages_content.json</data>
      <data key="d11">1783211091</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="(&quot;First Crusade&quot;, &quot;Byzantine Empire&quot;)" target="(&quot;alliance&quot;, &quot;aid&quot;)">
      <data key="d6">8.0</data>
      <data key="d7">"The Byzantines sought help from Christian Europeans during the First Crusade to recapture Jerusalem. Their alliance was based on mutual interests against Muslim rule.")</data>
      <data key="d8">aid,alliance</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-9cea715d402110c49c739e324bc54567</data>
