    <edge source="&lt;&quot;Yasa&quot;" target="&lt;&quot;Mongol women&quot;&gt;">
      <data key="d6">2.0</data>
      <data key="d7">&lt;"Yasa restricted raiding activities that historically led to social mobility for Mongol women, impacting their roles and status within the household and society."&gt;</data>
