    <edge source="&lt;&quot;Yasa&quot;" target="&lt;&quot;gender roles in Mongol society&quot;">
      <data key="d6">2.0</data>
      <data key="d7">&lt;"Yasa influenced gender roles by restricting activities historically significant for social mobility among women, limiting their opportunities within the household and society."&gt;</data>
      <data key="d8">&lt;"legal constraints on gender roles"&gt;</data>
