      <data key="d6">2.0</data>
      <data key="d7">&lt;"Zhongdu played a crucial role in both the Jin Dynasty and the Yuan dynasty, serving as a significant political center that persisted under different regimes."&gt;</data>
      <data key="d8">&lt;"political continuity,urban significance"&gt;</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-405d14b235f769c3d78504b096eb8659</data>
      <data key="d10">dumps/World_History_Volume_1/pages_content.json</data>
      <data key="d11">1783211092</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&lt;&quot;Mongol Empire&quot;" target="&lt;&quot;Chinggis Khan's Coronation&quot;">
      <data key="d6">4.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Chinggis Khan's coronation was a critical event that solidified his leadership and provided legitimate authority for the establishment of the Mongol Empire. This coronation not only justified Chinggis Khan’s rule but also laid the foundational framework necessary for the future expansion and governance of the vast empire. It set the stage for the Mongol Empire to pursue its ambitious goals under Chinggis Khan's guidance, making his leadership paramount in both establishing and expanding the empire's territorial and administrative reach.</data>
      <data key="d8">&lt;"legitimacy,authority"&gt;,expansion strategy"&gt;</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-405d14b235f769c3d78504b096eb8659</data>
      <data key="d10">dumps/World_History_Volume_1/pages_content.json</data>
      <data key="d11">1783211094</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&lt;&quot;Chinggis Khan's conquest tactics&quot;" target="&lt;&quot;Jin Dynasty, Xi Xia, Song Dynasty&quot;&gt;">
      <data key="d6">2.0</data>
      <data key="d7">&lt;"Chinggis Khan employed diverse conquest tactics against multiple enemies, including using their internal conflicts and cultural ties as tools for expansion."&gt;</data>
      <data key="d8">&lt;"diverse conquest methods,strategic use of cultural narratives"&gt;</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-405d14b235f769c3d78504b096eb8659</data>
      <data key="d10">dumps/World_History_Volume_1/pages_content.json</data>
      <data key="d11">1783211092</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;Delhi Sultanate collapse&quot;" target="&quot;Yuan Dynasty expansion attempts&quot;">
      <data key="d6">2.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Both entities represent efforts by Mongol-related powers to expand their influence during a period of broader political instability in the region.</data>
