      <data key="d6">2.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Sufism played a significant role in spreading Islam within the Yuan Dynasty, showing how religious movements influenced political and cultural developments.</data>
      <data key="d8">religious_and_political_influence</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-c71a838af77fbaa35a3faa2b0287f52d</data>
